  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/693c1924551373bfc9144f057e7c423cef6fc7dd\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"413\" height=\"416\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/693c1924551373bfc9144f057e7c423cef6fc7dd\" data-origin-width=\"614\" data-origin-height=\"619\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">RGB 값을 넣어</span></span></b> <b>인쇄한 용지에</b><br>RGB 3광원을 쏘아봅니다.<br>&#160;<br><b>어떻게 달라보일까요?</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/380709828df0d0142ab9b1b9c212af00f97d0758\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"464\" height=\"619\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/380709828df0d0142ab9b1b9c212af00f97d0758\" data-origin-width=\"1050\" data-origin-height=\"1400\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">교실에서 <b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">암실을 만들기가 어려운데</span></b><br>학생의 아이디어입니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">사.물.함.</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d15370b18c6bc79e69dbfee150db13ead10c19a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"322\" height=\"242\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d15370b18c6bc79e69dbfee150db13ead10c19a\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1575bfc9902acaebcbe1d7dd90c78098803a8437\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"338\" height=\"254\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1575bfc9902acaebcbe1d7dd90c78098803a8437\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">애들이 참 무서운게....<br>&#160;샘플 사진에 종이를<br>가로로 세워놓았더니<br><b>가로로 놓고 실험을 하더라구요 ㅠㅠ</b><br>조심할 부분인 것 같습니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">개당 3만원정도하는</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #8A3DB6;\">값비싼 손전등이지만</span></b><br>&#160;<br>아이들이 신기해하고,<br>반응이 좋은 교구라고 생각합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7f425b68de6650834126ab53c1791145074b2b6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7f425b68de6650834126ab53c1791145074b2b6\" data-origin-width=\"759\" data-origin-height=\"746\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d34baad2e01ca615f626d216fdb6fb76b45f72ad\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d34baad2e01ca615f626d216fdb6fb76b45f72ad\" data-origin-width=\"759\" data-origin-height=\"746\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/003eb2af5dcbcf49630e00d90cf9226af67eaa35\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/003eb2af5dcbcf49630e00d90cf9226af67eaa35\" data-origin-width=\"905\" data-origin-height=\"865\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9c8dc8a8e70be85dd95714ff07ce95e0eedc2e98\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9c8dc8a8e70be85dd95714ff07ce95e0eedc2e98\" data-origin-width=\"905\" data-origin-height=\"865\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/950314d1af2d7f8e97f8c1e2ab8f1a67b0f1e7d1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/950314d1af2d7f8e97f8c1e2ab8f1a67b0f1e7d1\" data-origin-width=\"728\" data-origin-height=\"712\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b4616e17d4e1d1ccefd30d1b539c83c93480e5af\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b4616e17d4e1d1ccefd30d1b539c83c93480e5af\" data-origin-width=\"728\" data-origin-height=\"712\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec9f2939decf2d8234636384ac1f08173678ea1d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec9f2939decf2d8234636384ac1f08173678ea1d\" data-origin-width=\"745\" data-origin-height=\"723\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/27ed8cd1ff09e4edbb8d51d724d03e6dfbe2f5b7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/27ed8cd1ff09e4edbb8d51d724d03e6dfbe2f5b7\" data-origin-width=\"745\" data-origin-height=\"723\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f620ddd5a6cdbbcf2e361ca7b7b88cd4341b0c92\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f620ddd5a6cdbbcf2e361ca7b7b88cd4341b0c92\" data-origin-width=\"811\" data-origin-height=\"783\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc76823d1753a5a14edbe0b7a08a548743dd4a1a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc76823d1753a5a14edbe0b7a08a548743dd4a1a\" data-origin-width=\"811\" data-origin-height=\"783\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/461061884ec957a30e221de91e8a6de33af5a470\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/461061884ec957a30e221de91e8a6de33af5a470\" data-origin-width=\"703\" data-origin-height=\"689\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e0817a6fc626ea043feb564e598b5339db5a3cc3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e0817a6fc626ea043feb564e598b5339db5a3cc3\" data-origin-width=\"703\" data-origin-height=\"689\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>실험 후,<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">이론과 결과가 차이가 많이나는</span></b><br>경우를 찾고<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">왜 그럴까</span></b><br><b>고민하는 시간을 가졌습니다.&#160;</b><br>&#160;<br>중1 학생들이라<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">암실이 아니라서 그렇다</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">암실에서 하면 잘될 것 같다.</span></b><br><b>로 수렴해서....</b><br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">탐구에 대해</span></b><br>고민...ㅠㅠ;;; 을 하는 기회가<br>었습니다. ㅠㅠ<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0edfa6e655b17d229c10fc6181939b49a6fc5cf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0edfa6e655b17d229c10fc6181939b49a6fc5cf\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">빛그림자 수업도</span></b><br>무척 매력적입니다. ^^<br>&#160;<br>연말, 따뜻하세요♥ ♥ ♥<br>&#160;<br>p.s.<br>손전등의 종류가 참 많은데요.<br>최근에 구입한 것 중에는<br><b>뒤에 주황색으로 버튼</b>이 되어있는 녀석이<br>세기도 세고,<br>손전등 1개가 3개 컬러를 모두 낼 수 있고<br>괜찮았습니다.<br>&#160;<br>전에 학교에서는 <b>플라스틱 보관통에</b><br>미니 삼각대까지 들어있는 세트<br>그 녀석이 참 괜찮았었는데...<br>급하게 산다고 못...찾....<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>#첨부파일은<b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"> RGB 컬러인쇄물</span></b>과<br>활동지입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a6382dc9bdd690e243a3b54c11dafb23b55ad8f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"312\" height=\"440\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a6382dc9bdd690e243a3b54c11dafb23b55ad8f\" data-origin-width=\"535\" data-origin-height=\"754\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5ef4e12c36a30b0cef3de1f3e588f99dd945faef\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"713\" height=\"501\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5ef4e12c36a30b0cef3de1f3e588f99dd945faef\" data-origin-width=\"1070\" data-origin-height=\"752\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7057a07a2a3816849a9784a425723ea16636039?download\" data-file-name=\"색에광원비추기_이미지와 관찰기록활동지.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"30433\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D175%26fileid%3D20%26regdt%3D20231207114316&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fe7057a07a2a3816849a9784a425723ea16636039')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">색에광원비추기_이미지와 관찰기록활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">29.72KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t